From: Yichao Yu <yyc1992@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 13:06:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Fix for Julia master

writefixed stops accepting negative precision.

Ref https://github.com/JuliaLang/julia/pull/62797
---
 Makie/src/tick_format.jl | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Makie/src/tick_format.jl b/Makie/src/tick_format.jl
index 399808f54..a1ae0feae 100644
--- a/Makie/src/tick_format.jl
+++ b/Makie/src/tick_format.jl
@@ -28,7 +28,7 @@ function _plain_label_precision(xs)
         e10min = min(e10min, e10)
         e10max = max(e10max, e10)
     end
-    return min(-e10min, -e10max + 16)
+    return max(min(-e10min, -e10max + 16), 0)
 end
 
 # Uniform precision (in fractional digits) for scientific notation across `xs`.
